# a format 24 project, from before knit's analog (format 25: TP_KANALOG after TP_RFB), and its presets (format 14: a
# user preset without it): saved by that build, for the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Track 3 knit
# with the Mod page set, track 4 rayon with its Ops page set (layer, 3.5:1, depth 70, feedback 30), saved as user
# preset U1.
# Run by a format 24 build (465188b): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v24.xy
wait 300
bpm 106
param 3 engine 0
param 3 ksync 1
param 3 ksweep 24
param 4 engine 1
param 4 rops 2
param 4 rratio 6
param 4 rdepth 70
param 4 rfb 30
wait 40
usersave 4 1
projsave 1 v24_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v24.bin
